            <p>Program PKL SMK RPL dirancang dengan komposisi 70% pengembangan website dan 30% optimasi mesin pencari (SEO) agar siswa memahami sisi teknis sekaligus performa website di Google.</p>

            <div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-tc-border">
              <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse text-xs md:text-sm">
                <thead>
                  <tr class="bg-tc-card text-white border-b border-tc-border">
                    <th class="p-3 font-bold">Bidang Praktik</th>
                    <th class="p-3 font-bold">Porsi</th>
                    <th class="p-3 font-bold">Materi & Tools</th>
                  </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody class="divide-y divide-tc-border/60 bg-tc-bg/40">
                  <tr>
                    <td class="p-3 font-semibold text-white">Pengembangan Website</td>
                    <td class="p-3">70%</td>
                    <td class="p-3">HTML, CSS, Bootstrap 5, Astro JS, Blogspot, Git & GitHub, deployment web</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td class="p-3 font-semibold text-white">SEO & Konten Teknis</td>
                    <td class="p-3">30%</td>
                    <td class="p-3">Struktur heading, metadata, optimasi gambar WebP, Google Search Console</td>
                  </tr>
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
          </section>

