            <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-tc-accent mb-1">Baca Juga</p>
            <a href="/blog/ide-project-pkl-rpl-portofolio" class="text-sm md:text-base font-bold text-white hover:text-tc-accent transition-colors">
              15 Ide Project PKL RPL yang Layak Masuk Portofolio &rarr;
            </a>
          </div>

