            </p>
            <p>Segera konfirmasi kuota periode sekolahmu melalui halaman <a href="/alur-pendaftaran" class="text-tc-accent underline hover:text-white">alur pendaftaran</a> atau hubungi admin via WhatsApp.</p>
          </section>

          <!-- AUTHOR BIO -->
          <div class="bg-tc-card/60 border border-tc-border rounded-2xl p-5 space-y-3 text-xs md:text-sm">
            <div>
              <p class="text-tc-muted uppercase tracking-wider text-[11px] font-bold">Penulis</p>
              <p class="font-bold text-white text-base">Yolanda Deva Apriliana Putri (YUL)</p>
